1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,112
Salesman ke liye ek alag simplified dashboard hai.

2
00:00:03,112 --> 00:00:08,154
Login karte hi aapko sirf apne customers, apne target, aur apne beat dikhte hain.

3
00:00:08,154 --> 00:00:10,084
My Sales — is month kitna kiya.

4
00:00:10,084 --> 00:00:12,201
My Target — kitna reach karna hai.

5
00:00:12,201 --> 00:00:15,562
My Customers — poori list, filter aur search ke saath.

6
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:18,363
My Beat — is week kis kis ko visit karna hai.

7
00:00:18,363 --> 00:00:21,476
Owner ka poora data nahi dikhta — sirf aapka apna.

8
00:00:21,476 --> 00:00:23,592
Clean, focused, aur phone pe fast.

9
00:00:23,592 --> 00:00:25,896
Field mein use karne ke liye perfect.
